const pageNames={'customer-data':'顧客・契約のデータ管理',customers:'顧客一覧',order:'制服を依頼する',history:'依頼履歴',staff:'社内受付の確認',setup:'顧客・契約管理',organization:'顧客の組織構成・社内担当',settings:'部署・契約・制服',details:'拠点の詳細','web-settings':'WEB依頼の設定'};
function tab(id,updateHistory=true){if(id!==mode&&window.CustomerData&&!window.CustomerData.canLeave())return false;if(id!==mode&&window.SiteDetails&&!window.SiteDetails.canLeave())return false;if(['customer-data','customers','setup','settings','organization','details'].includes(id)&&!sharedPage&&!data.previewAccountId&&!data.previewPageId){if(!leave())return false;const u=new URL(sharedSettingsUrl(),location.origin);u.searchParams.set('page',id);location.href=u.pathname+u.search;return false;}if(sharedPage&&!data.previewAccountId&&!data.previewPageId&&['order','history','staff','web-settings'].includes(id)){if(window.WebRequestOrganization&&!window.WebRequestOrganization.canLeave())return false;if(!leave())return false;const u=new URL('/request-web',location.origin);u.searchParams.set('page',id);const customer=mode==='organization'?Number($('#org-root-customer').value)||cid():cid();if(customer)u.searchParams.set('customer_id',customer);location.href=u.pathname+u.search;return false;}if(!Object.hasOwn(pageNames,id))id='order';if((data.previewAccountId||data.previewPageId)&&['staff','customer-data','customers','setup','settings','organization','details','web-settings'].includes(id))return false;if(id!==mode){if(window.WebRequestOrganization&&!window.WebRequestOrganization.canLeave())return false;if(!leave())return false;if(sharedPage&&mode==='organization'&&Number($('#org-root-customer').value))chooseCustomer(Number($('#org-root-customer').value));if(sharedPage&&id==='organization')$('#org-root-customer').value=String(cid()||'');mode=id;scopeOptions();draft=profile()?clone(profile().draft):null;document.querySelector('.hero').hidden=id!=='order';document.querySelector('.context p').textContent=id==='settings'?'設定する顧客・部署・契約を選んでください。':'選択した部署・契約の反映済み制服を表示します。';renderDepartments()}['order','history','staff','customer-data','customers','setup','settings','organization','details','web-settings'].forEach(x=>$('#'+x)&&($('#'+x).hidden=x!==id));document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.tab===id));$('.context').hidden=sharedPage||!['order','settings'].includes(id);syncOrderLayout();document.body.dataset.requestPage=id;document.title=pageNames[id]+(sharedPage?' | 指示書デスク':' | WEB依頼');window.WebRequestOrganization?.configurePanel(id);if(['organization','web-settings'].includes(id))window.WebRequestOrganization?.render();renderRecords();syncSharedLink();if(id==='customers')window.CustomerDirectory?.render();if(id==='customer-data')window.CustomerData?.render();if(id==='details')window.SiteDetails?.render();if(updateHistory){const url=new URL(location.href);if(url.searchParams.get('page')!==id){url.searchParams.set('page',id);history.pushState({page:id},'',url)}}return true}
window.addEventListener('popstate',()=>{const id=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('page')||'order';if(!tab(id,false)){const url=new URL(location.href);url.searchParams.set('page',mode);history.pushState({page:mode},'',url)}});

document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button');if(!b)return;if(b.dataset.tab)tab(b.dataset.tab);if(b.dataset.add){if(data.previewCanRequest===false)return notify('この利用者は閲覧のみです。');const p=products.find(x=>x.id===b.dataset.add),size=document.querySelector(`[data-size="${p.id}"]`).value,qty=Number(document.querySelector(`[data-qty="${p.id}"]`).value);if(!Number.isInteger(qty)||qty<1||qty>99)return notify('数量は1〜99で入力してください。');const old=cart.find(x=>x.id===p.id&&x.size===size);if(old&&old.qty+qty>99)return notify('同じ商品の数量は99点までです。');if(old)old.qty+=qty;else cart.push({id:p.id,name:p.name,color:p.color,size,qty,customer_product_id:p.customer_product_id,product_id:p.product_id,embroidery:p.embroidery,default_qty:p.contract_qty,hem_processing:!!p.hem_processing,processing_days:p.hem_processing?Number(p.processing_days)||0:0});renderCart();notify('ご依頼内容に追加しました。')}if(b.dataset.remove!==undefined){cart.splice(Number(b.dataset.remove),1);renderCart()}if(b.dataset.accept||b.dataset.return){const r=requests.find(x=>x.id===(b.dataset.accept||b.dataset.return));r.status=b.dataset.accept?'受付済み':'差し戻し';save();renderRecords()}});
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(requests));return true}catch{notify('ブラウザーに保存できませんでした。');return false}}
$('#search').oninput=renderProducts;
const WEEKDAYS_JP='月火水木金土日',COLLECTION_DAYS=['月','火','水','木','金','土'],DESIRED_LEAD_DAYS=2;
function localISODate(d){return [d.getFullYear(),String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0'),String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')].join('-')}
function requestToday(){return window.WebRequestDelivery?.today||localISODate(new Date())}
function addISODate(iso,days){const [y,m,d]=iso.split('-').map(Number),dt=new Date(y,m-1,d);dt.setDate(dt.getDate()+days);return localISODate(dt)}
function weekdayJp(iso){const [y,m,d]=iso.split('-').map(Number),wd=new Date(y,m-1,d).getDay();return WEEKDAYS_JP[wd===0?6:wd-1]}
function formatJpDate(iso){const [y,m,d]=iso.split('-').map(Number);return `${Number(m)}月${Number(d)}日（${weekdayJp(iso)}）`}
function cartProcessingDays(){let max=0;for(const item of cart){const p=products.find(x=>x.id===item.id)||item;if(p.hem_processing)max=Math.max(max,Number(p.processing_days)||0)}return max}
function selectedOrgNode(){const nodes=data.organizations?.nodes||[],id=$('#scope-select')?.value;if(id)return nodes.find(n=>n.id===id)||null;return nodes.find(n=>n.kind==='company'&&n.customer_id===cid())||null}
function resolveDelivery(node){const nodes=data.organizations?.nodes||[];let cur=node,seen=new Set();while(cur&&!seen.has(cur.id)){seen.add(cur.id);const method=(cur.delivery_method||'').trim();if(method)return {method,days:method==='自社集配'?COLLECTION_DAYS.filter(d=>(cur.collection_days||[]).includes(d)):[]};cur=nodes.find(n=>n.id===cur.parent_id)}return {method:'',days:[]}}
function earliestDesiredDate(today,processing){return addISODate(today,DESIRED_LEAD_DAYS+(Number(processing)||0))}
function isAllowedDesiredDate(iso,earliest,method,days){if(!iso||iso<earliest)return false;if(method==='自社集配'&&days.length)return days.includes(weekdayJp(iso));return true}
function nextAllowedDesiredDate(earliest,method,days){let iso=earliest;for(let i=0;i<400;i++){if(isAllowedDesiredDate(iso,earliest,method,days))return iso;iso=addISODate(iso,1)}return earliest}
function desiredDeliveryHint(earliest,nxt,processing,method,days){const reason='依頼日から2日後'+(processing?'＋裾上げ'+processing+'日':'');let text='最短は'+formatJpDate(earliest)+'です（'+reason+'）。';if(method==='自社集配'&&days.length)text+='次回の集配日は'+formatJpDate(nxt)+'です。この拠点の集配曜日（'+days.join('・')+'）だけ選べます。';else text+='この日以降を選んでください。';return text}
function desiredDeliveryState(){const today=requestToday(),processing=cartProcessingDays(),earliest=earliestDesiredDate(today,processing),resolved=resolveDelivery(selectedOrgNode()),nxt=nextAllowedDesiredDate(earliest,resolved.method,resolved.days);return {today,processing,earliest,next:nxt,...resolved}}
function ensureDeliveryHint(){if(!$('#delivery')||$('#delivery-hint'))return;const p=document.createElement('p');p.id='delivery-hint';p.className='small delivery-hint';const label=$('#delivery').closest('label');if(label&&label.parentNode)label.after(p);else $('#delivery').after(p);$('#delivery').addEventListener('change',()=>syncDesiredDelivery({fromInput:true}));$('#delivery').addEventListener('input',()=>syncDesiredDelivery({fromInput:true}))}
function syncDesiredDelivery(opts={}){if(!$('#delivery'))return;ensureDeliveryHint();const st=desiredDeliveryState();$('#delivery').min=st.earliest;const hint=$('#delivery-hint');if(hint)hint.textContent=desiredDeliveryHint(st.earliest,st.next,st.processing,st.method,st.days);const current=$('#delivery').value;if(!current||!isAllowedDesiredDate(current,st.earliest,st.method,st.days)){const prev=current;$('#delivery').value=st.next;if(opts.fromInput||(prev&&prev!==st.next))notify('納品希望日を'+formatJpDate(st.next)+'に変更しました。'+desiredDeliveryHint(st.earliest,st.next,st.processing,st.method,st.days))}return st}
function assertDesiredDelivery(){const st=desiredDeliveryState(),current=$('#delivery')?.value;if(!isAllowedDesiredDate(current,st.earliest,st.method,st.days)){syncDesiredDelivery({fromInput:true});return false}return true}
window.WebRequestDelivery={leadDays:DESIRED_LEAD_DAYS,localISODate,addISODate,weekdayJp,formatJpDate,earliestDesiredDate,isAllowedDesiredDate,nextAllowedDesiredDate,desiredDeliveryHint,resolveDelivery,syncDesiredDelivery,requestToday,processingDays:cartProcessingDays};

ensureDeliveryHint();syncDesiredDelivery();
$('#request-form').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();if(data.previewCanRequest===false)return notify('この利用者は閲覧のみです。');if(!cart.length)return notify('依頼する制服を追加してください。');if(!assertDesiredDelivery())return;$('#confirmation').innerHTML=`<p>${esc($('#customer').selectedOptions[0]?.textContent||'')} / ${esc($('#department').selectedOptions[0]?.textContent||'')} / ${esc(orderContractName())} / ${esc($('#request-type').value)} /   ${esc($('#wearer').value)} 様<br>納品希望日 ${esc($('#delivery').value)}</p><ul>${cart.map(x=>`<li>${esc(x.name)} · ${esc(x.color)} / ${esc(x.size)} / ${x.qty}点${x.default_qty?`（契約 ${x.default_qty}枚）`:""} ${esc(x.embroidery||"")}</li>`).join('')}</ul><p>${esc($('#notes').value)}</p>`;$('#confirm').showModal()};
function initializeSharedShell(){if(sharedPage){document.body.classList.add('desk-common-page');$('footer p').textContent='顧客・契約の共通登録';$('header nav').innerHTML='<a href="/" data-workspace-switch>業務を切り替える</a><button data-tab="customers">顧客一覧</button><button data-tab="setup">顧客の設定</button><button data-tab="organization">組織構成・担当者</button><button data-tab="settings">部署・契約・制服</button><button data-tab="details">拠点の詳細</button>';document.querySelectorAll('header [data-tab]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.tab===mode));$('.brand span').textContent='顧客・契約管理';$('.brand').href='/';$('.preview').firstChild.textContent='社内営業向け · 契約・対象制服・枚数はWEB依頼とユニフォーム管理で共通利用します。 ';const back=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('return_to')||'/';let dest='/';try{const url=new URL(back,location.origin);if(url.origin===location.origin&&['/','/rental','/request-web','/customer-contracts'].includes(url.pathname))dest=url.pathname+url.search}catch{}$('#common-settings-return').href=dest;$('#common-settings-return').hidden=dest==='/';}if(sharedPage){$('#contract-diagram-panel').hidden=false;$('#contract-editor-selectors').append($('#department').closest('label'),$('#contract-field'));$('#save-settings').textContent='契約・制服の設定を保存';$('#reload-settings').textContent='未保存の変更を取り消す';document.querySelector('.hero').hidden=true;$('.context').hidden=true;$('#order').hidden=true;$('#setup').hidden=false;$('#desk-customer-context').hidden=false;$('#desk-customer-name').textContent='読み込み中…';document.querySelectorAll('[data-common-destination]').forEach(b=>b.disabled=true);}}

function syncHemFields(){const on=$('#hem-processing')?.checked;if($('#processing-days-field'))$('#processing-days-field').hidden=!on;if($('#processing-days'))$('#processing-days').required=!!on}
function ensureHemFields(){if(!$('#uniform-form')||$('#hem-processing'))return;const qty=$('#uniform-qty')?.closest('label'),box=document.createElement('div');box.className='hem-processing-fields';box.innerHTML='<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="hem-processing">裾上げ（他）</label><label id="processing-days-field" hidden>加工日数（日）<input type="number" id="processing-days" min="1" max="365" step="1" inputmode="numeric"></label><p class="small">裾上げなど、日数がかかる加工があるときに付けます。WEB依頼の納品希望日の制限に後で使います。</p>';if(qty&&qty.parentNode)qty.parentNode.insertBefore(box,qty.nextSibling);else $('#uniform-form').append(box);$('#hem-processing').addEventListener('change',syncHemFields);syncHemFields()}
function ensureDetailsPage(){if($('#details'))return;const settings=$('#settings');if(!settings)return;const section=document.createElement('section');section.id='details';section.hidden=true;section.innerHTML='<div class="section-title"><div><h2>拠点の詳細</h2><p>会社と拠点の連絡先・顧客コードを、1件ずつ穴埋めします。配送方法と集配曜日は「組織構成・担当者」で設定し、ここでは表示だけします。項目はあとから増やせます。</p></div></div><div class="site-details-layout"><aside class="site-details-list request-record"><h3>この会社の会社・拠点</h3><ul id="details-list"></ul></aside><form id="details-form" class="request-record" hidden><h3 id="details-form-title">詳細を入力</h3><p id="details-code-note" class="small"></p><label>顧客コード<input id="details-customer-code" maxlength="12" autocomplete="off" placeholder="C0001"></label><label>正式名称<input id="details-official-name" maxlength="100" required></label><label>フリガナ<input id="details-kana" maxlength="80"></label><label>郵便番号<input id="details-postal-code" maxlength="20"></label><label>住所<input id="details-address" maxlength="200"></label><label>電話<input id="details-phone" maxlength="40"></label><label>FAX<input id="details-fax" maxlength="40"></label><label>先方担当者<input id="details-contact" maxlength="80"></label><label>メール<input id="details-email" maxlength="120"></label><label>メモ<textarea id="details-memo" maxlength="2000" rows="4"></textarea></label><p id="details-delivery" class="site-details-delivery"></p><p id="details-error" class="error" role="alert"></p><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="details-save" type="submit">この内容を保存</button></div></form></div>';settings.after(section)}
function deliverySummary(node){if(!node)return '未設定';const method=node.delivery_method||'';const days=(node.collection_days||[]).join('');if(!method)return '未設定';return method==='自社集配'?(days?'自社集配・'+days:'自社集配（曜日未設定）'):method}
